flowchart TD
    A[Terminal workflow, Swagger or API client] --> B[FastAPI LoggedRoute]
    B --> C[Log request method, path and handler]
    C --> D[Pydantic validates path, query and body fields]
    D -->|Invalid| E[Log rejection and return 422]
    D -->|Valid| F[Feature route]

    F --> G[Controller builds required dependencies]
    G --> H[Use case applies business rules]
    H --> I{External or specialized work needed?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Call service such as Nmap, AI, report or lab]
    I -->|No| K[Continue to persistence]
    J --> K
    K --> L[Repository performs SQLAlchemy operation]
    L --> M[(Configured SQL database)]
    M --> N[Return model or result to use case]
    N --> O[Controller returns result to route]
    O --> P[FastAPI serializes response]
    P --> Q[LoggedRoute records status and duration]
    Q --> R[Client receives response]

    H -->|Expected business rejection| S[Raise HTTPException]
    S --> T[Log rejection and return 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 502 or 504]
    H -->|Unexpected exception| U[Log stack trace and return 500]

    NOTE[JWT is issued at login and sent by PTASApiClient,<br/>but current feature routes do not enforce a token dependency]
    NOTE -.-> F
